# Command Code's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-commandcode-setting-cookie = 登录 https://commandcode.ai，打开“开发者工具 > 应用 > Cookie”，选择 https://commandcode.ai，并复制会话 Cookie：__Secure-better-auth.session_token（或 __Secure-commandcode_prod_.session_token，以实际存在者为准）。以“name=value”格式粘贴。

## The report: the plan's monthly credits and any bought on top. Plan
## names (Go, Pro, Max, Ultra) stay as Command Code names its plans.

# The balance: dollars of the plan's monthly credits left.
usage-commandcode-monthly-left = 本月剩余点数
# The balance: dollars of credits bought beyond the plan.
usage-commandcode-purchased = 已购点数
